      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "\"The Vessel of Life: Its Potential and Prospects\"",
        "Jp" : "\"命の器・その可能性と展望\""
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 207100,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Pure essence, void of form, \r\nyet able to transform—if \r\none condenses and purifies life, \r\nit may ascend to energy \r\nof the same nature as \r\ndragon force.",
        "Jp" : "純粋なる精にして、なにものでもなく、\r\nなにものにも変じうる力――\r\nすなわち生命を凝縮し純化するならば、それは\r\n竜力と同質のエネルギーに昇華可能である"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 214190,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It's not just about Goliath operations \r\nor controlling the magick. If we can \r\nartificially generate sufficient dragon force, \r\nit could lead to a great invention \r\nthat reforms the very fabric of the world.",
        "Jp" : "ゴリアテ運用や錬魔の制御だけではない\r\n十分な竜力を人為的に生み出すことができれば、\r\n世界のありようそのものを改革しうる、\r\n大いなる発明につながるであろう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 214193,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The success of the \r\nVessel of Life will bring \r\na glorious golden dawn \r\nto the world of man.",
        "Jp" : "《命の器》の成功は、人の世に輝かしき\r\n黄金の夜明けをもたらすものである"
      },
